TIME STATEMENT - CORTEX BASIC REV. 1.1

              2         IDT  'TIME'
              3  *
              4  * THIS MODULE CONTAINS THE ROUTINE THAT SETS UP THE
              5  * TIME STORAGE AREA FOR BASIC AND ALSO RETURNS TO BASIC THE
              6  * CURRENT TIME
              7  *
              8  *      TIME                   - OUTPUT THE TIME
              9  *      TIME <EXP>,<EXP>,<EXP> - SET THE TIME
             10  *      TIME <VAR>             - GET REAL TIME CLOCK IN <VAR>
             11  *
             12  * MODULE DEFINITIONS:
             13  *
             14         DEF  TIMY
             15  *
             16  * EXTERNAL ROUTINES:
             17  *
             18         REF  CKEX,EVSDZ,TYPB$,NLIN
             19  *
             20  * EXTERNAL DATA:
             21  *
             22         REF  B20,CLKADR,FPWP,IOB
             23         REF  TIMC,BFA,B3A
             24  *
             25  * XOP EQUATES
             26  *
             27         DXOP EVFIX,11
